# Claude #2: every right-angle triangle with whole-number sides (a and b up to 20).
# Guess a, b, c. If a*a + b*b is not c*c, the world sinks. `more` keeps each one found.
use stdlib
1 20 wave 1 bury
1 dig 1 + 20 wave 2 bury
2 dig 1 + 30 wave 3 bury
1 dig sq 2 dig sq + 3 dig sq = want
1 dig . 2 dig . 3 dig . ." | " more
